  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "A Spatially Coordinated Keratinocyte-Fibroblast Circuit Recruits MMP9+ Myeloid Cells to Drive IFN-I-Driven Inflammation in Photosensitive Autoimmunity",
  "description": "Community Contributed publication dataset from Manuel Garber and John E. Harris of the University of Massachusetts Chan Medical School Vitiligo Center of Research Translation (V-CoRT). Using a variety of investigational methods the authors examined in vivo and in vitro samples to investigate an interferon-I (IFN-I)-amplified skin pathology and identified MMP9+ CD14+ myeloid cells as central effectors of photosensitivity in both cutaneous lupus erythematosus and dermatomyositis.",
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "citeAs": "A Spatially Coordinated Keratinocyte-Fibroblast Circuit Recruits MMP9+ Myeloid Cells to Drive IFN-I-Driven Inflammation in Photosensitive Autoimmunity. https://doi.org/10.7303/syn71964948.1",
  "creator": {
    "@type": "sc:Person",
    "name": "Jessica Vera",
    "url": "https://www.synapse.org/#!Profile:3499646"
  },
